exports[`ManageInventoryTool — characterization > check-encumbrance — formatted report (over encumbered) 1`] = `
"⚖️ **Hans Müller** - Encumbrance Check

**Current Encumbrance:** 10 Enc
**Maximum Encumbrance:** 4 Enc
**Strength Bonus:** 2
**Toughness Bonus:** 2

🔴 **OVER ENCUMBERED** by 6 Enc!

**Penalties:**
- -20 to all Agility tests
- Movement speed halved
- Cannot take Run action
- May gain Fatigued condition

**Solutions:**
- Drop 6+ Enc of items
- Store items on mount/vehicle
- Distribute items among party
"
`;

